For marshaling and unmarshaling XNSCH.Item.
Unmarshaling of a single value

Unmarshaling of SEQUENCE of xxx from the Item into a LIST for Cedar


"Simple" Marshaling PROCs:

Now for lists
SizeOf PROCs
Now SizeOf lists
IntoItem PROCs
Now the lists
